Package: libgnome-autoar-0-0
Version: @DEB_GNOME-AUTOAR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-autoar
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libarchive13, libgtk-4-1
Description: Automatic archive extraction/compression library - runtime
 gnome-autoar wraps libarchive with a GLib/GObject API for (de)compressing
 archives. Used by nautilus. This package contains the shared library.
